From 2e64150dfa0693d4cf4b333fe94e167f7bb7ce88 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 15:07:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] right stick as the console's motion (LEGO City)

InputState gains turn (about the upright axis) on top of tilt; the
gyroscope and accelerometer read both. The title hooks turn and tilt the
console with the right stick, for the game's motion look-around.
